# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100009> (GATA4-related congenital heart disease with or without pancreatic hypoplasia or diabetes)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "MONDO:patterns/disease_series_by_gene") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:12845333") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21220346") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:24696446") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41006196") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40130/") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100009> "Any congenital heart disease in which the cause of the disease is a mutation in the GATA4 gene, occurring with or without other syndromic features including pancreatic hypoplasia or agenesis, diabetes, and disorders of sex development.")
