# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100062> (genetic developmental and epileptic encephalopathy)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28276062") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100062> "A complex neurodevelopmental disorder characterized by a range of developmental delays and epileptic encephalopathy phenotypes. Seizure onset is variable and intellectual disability is variable in presence and severity.")
