# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100089> (GATA1-Related X-Linked Cytopenia)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:18930124") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:20301538") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28895773") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40028/") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6964-7302") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100089> "X-Linked cytopenia characterized by anemia and/or thrombocytopenia. Additional features including platelet dysfunction, dyserythropoesis, mild beta-thalassemia, neutropenia, or congenital erythropoetic porphyria may be present. These GATA1 variants are germline as opposed to GATA1 variants seen in leukemia.")
