# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100162> (IKBKG-related immunodeficiency with or without ectodermal dysplasia)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:11047757") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:35163099") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7437-8060") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100162> "Any recessive immunodeficiency (ID), with or without ectodermal dysplasia (EDA), in which the cause of the disease is mutation in the IKBKG gene. ID/EDA-ID patients, always males, are hemizygous for an IKBKG (NEMO) mutation that preserves residual NF-κB activation (hypomorphic mutations) and may also present with osteopetrosis and lymphoedema (OL-EDA-ID).")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000233> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100162> "https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/5520"^^xsd:anyURI)
