# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100176> (AP-4 deficiency syndrome)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29193663") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29430868") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:30543385") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:32171285") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40006/") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100176> "A genetic disorder associated with variation(s) in the AP4 genes: AP4B1, AP4E1, AP4M1, and AP4S1. The phenotypes observed in individuals with genetic variants in these genes are often complex and include intellectual disability, spastic paraplegia, microcephaly, brain abnormalities, and seizures.")
