# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100498> (UROD-related inherited porphyria)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100498> "Porphyria caused by monoallelic and biallelic variants in UROD and presenting as a spectrum of disease (a semidominant inheritance pattern). Additionally, environmental factors almost always play a role in the disease. Monoallelic variants when exacerbated by environmental factors can result in episodic adult onset of photosensitivity. Biallelic variants that reduce WT enzyme activity <20% cause childhood onset of photosensitivity and sometimes liver damage.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000233> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100498> "https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/5128"^^xsd:anyURI)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000233> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100498> "https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703"^^xsd:anyURI)
