# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100502> (NTHL1-deficiency tumor predisposition syndrome)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40023/") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100502> "Biallelic constitutional/germline loss-of-function NTHL1 variants confer predisposition to tumor formation demonstrating ‘COSMIC Signature 30’ mutation profile. Tumors have been reported at multiple primary sites; in particular adenomatous polyposis of colon (~10-50 polyps), colorectal cancer, and breast cancer.")
