# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100571> (CTNNB1-related neurodevelopmental disorder and/or vitreoretinopathy)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40006/") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100571> "Any neurodevelopmental disorder and/or exudative vitreoretinopathy caused by a monoallelic variant in the CTNNB1 gene. Variants in CTNNB1 are related to a neurodevelopmental condition with a broad spectrum of presentations ranging from isolated vitreoretinopathy to a complex neurodevelopmental disorder with mild to severe intellectual disability, microcephaly, spasticity, autism spectrum disorder, and visual defects, including retinal detachment, and abnormal retinal vascularization.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000233> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100571> "https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/7572"^^xsd:anyURI)
